    "chunk_text": "On \u00feisum \u00ferim stelum stynt se cynestol, & gif an bi\u00f0 forud, he fyl\u00f0 adun sona \u00feam o\u00f0rum stelum to Ac hw\u00e6t gebyra\u00f0 us embe \u00feis to smeagenne? \u00deis sceolon smeagan \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s giman sceolon. Se rihtwisa God lufa\u00f0 rihte domas; ac medsceattas awenda\u00f0 wolice to oft \u00fea rihtan domas ongean Se \u00fee Godes \u00feegen bi\u00f0, sceolde deman rihtlice butan \u00e6lcum medsceatte mid so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse; \u00feonne Amen. Ic wolde secgan be \u00feam unges\u00e6ligum folce, be \u00feam Iudeiscum, \u00fee urne Drihten ahengon, ac ic Manega \u00f0\u00e6r gelyfdon of \u00feam mancinne on Crist, ac se m\u00e6sta d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s mancinnes nolde on hine Him becomon fela yrm\u00f0a \u00e6fter Cristes \u00ferowunge on eallum ungelimpum, & ofslagenne wurdon fela & hi acwealdon Cristes apostolas \u00feone gingran Iacob & \u00feone rihtwisan Iacob, & Stephanum \u00d0a sende he him to sillice tacna & si\u00f0\u00f0an hergunge \u00feurh \u00fea Romaniscan. Vespassianus w\u00e6s casere on \u00feam timan; se asende him to his sunu Titum mid micelre fyrde \u00fe\u00e6s Hi cuwon heora girdlas & g\u00e6rs \u00e6ton georne, & \u00e6lc l\u00e6hte of o\u00f0rum, gif he hw\u00e6t litles h\u00e6fde, & \u00f0one Nys us na to secgenne \u00feone sceamlican mor\u00f0 \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r gedon w\u00e6s, ac hi wurdon adydde mid \u00feam Of \u00feam iungum cnihtum, \u00fee comon of \u00f0am hungre, on eallum \u00feam lande hi al\u00e6ddon aweg to Nu miht \u00feu wel",
